<Doc slug="join-a-vault">
  <h2>Before you start</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Install Zafe. Join only with an invite you expected, from someone you know.</li>
    <li>Keep time for a call or a meeting with the other members: you’ll compare safety words.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Steps</h2>
  <ol class="doc-steps">
    <li>Tap the invite link. It opens Zafe on <strong>Join a vault</strong>. Or open Zafe, tap <strong>Join with an invite</strong>, then <strong>Paste</strong> the invite or <strong>Scan QR code</strong>.</li>
    <li>Check the line under the invite: the vault’s name, its rule and its server, such as “Grants · 2 of 3 · relay.zafe.cash”.</li>
    <li>Enter <strong>Your name</strong>, shown to the other members, and tap <strong>Join vault</strong>.</li>
    <li>Wait for the others. You can close Zafe: it tells you when it’s your turn.</li>
    <li>Compare the <a href="/docs/safety-words">safety words</a> with every member, then tap <strong>They match</strong>.</li>
    <li>When the vault is ready, <a href="/docs/backups">back up</a> your key share.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>If it goes wrong</h2>
  <dl class="doc-fixes">
    <div><dt>“This doesn’t look like a Zafe invite”</dt><dd>Copy the whole link again, or ask for a new one.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>“This invite expired”</dt><dd>Invites last 3 days. Ask the creator to share it again.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>“The creator cancelled this setup”</dt><dd>Tap <strong>Leave setup</strong> and ask them for a new invite.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</Doc>
